OK   grammar: S-strings and P-strings with c ones have the same values, c <= 17
OK   grammar: for every n <= 400 with MinOnes(n) <= 17, the fewest 1s over the grammar is MinOnes(n)  [293 values of n]
OK   grammar: no n <= 400 with MinOnes(n) > 17 has an expression with <= 17 ones
OK   grammar: every value with c ones is at most 3^(c/3)-ish (sanity: max value with 12 ones is 81)
OK   string generator = the grammar (Earley) on all 5^l strings of length l <= 7
