OK   handout: (1+(3-2))-(5+1)-(6+7) = -17
OK   handout values -1, -15, 9, -17 are all reachable
OK   handout example: maximum 21, minimum -17 (the handout's last example is already the minimum)  [(21, -17, 21, -17)]
OK   handout example: Max(0, 6) = Max(0, 1) - Min(2, 6) = 4 - (-17)
